+/**
+ * The quick download menu of downloaders that apply the requested quality (YTindir),
+ * laid out like the quick list of YTindir:
+ * the title with the channel and length, the video qualities (4K and 2K in the better of AV1 and VP9,
+ * 1080p and below in H.264), audio only as M4A (the AAC stream as it is) or an MP3, and the JPG thumbnail.
+ * Frame rates, codecs and file sizes are filled in once the video's streams are read.
+ * <p>
+ * A tap on a quality or an audio format marks it, and Download downloads the marked one.
+ * All options opens the download window of the downloader with all its options. The thumbnail is downloaded right away.
+ */
+public final class QuickDownloadMenu {
+
+    /**
+     * Opens the downloader.
+     */
